DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11030::$$$message_0087_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, Emiya, did you hear?"[lr]::
11031::$$$message_0087_0000_0001$$$::A familiar voice stops me in front of the third years' classrooms.[lr]::
11032::$$$message_0087_0000_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri, and Tohsaka as well, the beautiful duo who were the pride of the third years of Homurahara.[lr]::
11033::$$$message_0087_0000_0003$$$::It's hard to believe that I'm acquaintances with both of them at all.::
11034::$$$message_0087_0001_0000$$$::"Morning Mitsuzuri, Tohsaka."[lr]::
11035::$$$message_0087_0001_0001$$$::"Morning, Emiya."[lr]::
11036::$$$message_0087_0001_0002$$$::"Did you hear that she finally came back?"[lr]::
11037::$$$message_0087_0001_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri points at Tohsaka.[lr]::
11038::$$$message_0087_0001_0004$$$::Of course I know, so I nod. We are basically living together.::
11039::$$$message_0087_0002_0000$$$::"Yeah, I came back from abroad."[lr]::
11040::$$$message_0087_0002_0001$$$::"She was on a trip to England this entire time.[lr]::
11041::$$$message_0087_0002_0002$$$::I can't believe you, skipping school to go on a trip all the way to England. What happened to the model student?"[lr]::
11042::$$$message_0087_0002_0003$$$::For Mitsuzuri to be lamenting like that, she must be jealous. There's no doubt I would've thought the same if I didn't know the circumstances.::
11043::$$$message_0087_0003_0000$$$::"So, where did you go? London? Wales or Loch Ness or anything like that?"[lr]::
11044::$$$message_0087_0003_0001$$$::"Unfortunately, I didn't sightsee that much.[lr]::
11045::$$$message_0087_0003_0002$$$::You know I have a lot going on next year, too."[lr]::
11046::$$$message_0087_0003_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02a(中) textoff=0]Yes. The surface-level reason for Tohsaka's trip is supposed to be prep for studying abroad in London.::
11047::$$$message_0087_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, I see. Figuring out where you're gonna stay early, eh?"[lr]::
11048::$$$message_0087_0004_0001$$$::"That too, and there's a lot of things that I want to arrange in advance.[lr]::
11049::$$$message_0087_0004_0002$$$::Besides, I need to get familiarized with the environment I'm going to be living in early on."[lr]::
11050::$$$message_0087_0004_0003$$$::She says she's a scholarship student, but really it means that it's essential to make necessary arrangements.::
11051::$$$message_0087_0005_0000$$$::"You already have a recommendation from that school, right? I'm jealous of model students."[lr]::
11052::$$$message_0087_0005_0001$$$::"You know just as well as I do that it'd be a cakewalk for you too. I know you nailed your last tests."[lr]::
11053::$$$message_0087_0005_0002$$$::"Even then, they weren't as good as yours. Geez, what do you think of Miss Model Student, Emiya?"[cacheimage storage=凛制服05b(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服05b(中) textoff=0]::
11054::$$$message_0087_0006_0000$$$::"Don't look at me, I did horrible on the tests."[lr]::
11055::$$$message_0087_0006_0001$$$::"You're too much of a space case, Emiya. If you're not careful, you'll be held back and have to graduate with Matou."[lr]::
11056::$$$message_0087_0006_0002$$$::"Oh, Emiya looks as if there's nothing wrong with that."[lr]::
11057::$$$message_0087_0006_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02a(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka really enjoys teasing me like this.[lr]::
11058::$$$message_0087_0006_0004$$$::That would mean I get held back, but I haven't been doing [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] bad.::
11059::$$$message_0087_0007_0000$$$::"Well, if it comes down to it...[cacheimage storage=凛制服03c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服03c(中) textoff=0]I can look after him."[lr]::
11060::$$$message_0087_0007_0001$$$::"Huh? Are you going to tutor him or something?"[lr]::
11061::$$$message_0087_0007_0002$$$::"Not only that, but I can help him find a place after graduating."[lr]::
11062::$$$message_0087_0007_0003$$$::Wow, in front of Mitsuzuri like this... If you were saying this sort of thing in front of Issei, it'd be a critical blow.[lr]::
11063::$$$message_0087_0007_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02e(中) textoff=0]Mitsuzuri is looking at me with a question in her eyes.::
11064::$$$message_0087_0008_0000$$$::"Uh, you know...I can do housework and all, so..."[lr]::
11065::$$$message_0087_0008_0001$$$::"Emiya might be in the mood to try studying abroad or something too. [cacheimage storage=凛制服04c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服04c(中) textoff=0]And the rent will be cheaper if we share a room."[lr]::
11066::$$$message_0087_0008_0002$$$::"Dang... Are you sure you're okay with that?"[lr]::
11067::$$$message_0087_0008_0003$$$::That's like saying we'll live together by studying abroad. Well, she is saying that we're going to share a room.[lr]::
11068::$$$message_0087_0008_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服01b(中) textoff=0]...Though it's true that we won't have the financial freedom to be able to live in different lodgings if we go over there.::
11069::$$$message_0087_0009_0000$$$::"What is Emiya going to study abroad?[lr]::
11070::$$$message_0087_0009_0001$$$::Wait, are you sure you would be okay taking him?"[lr]::
11071::$$$message_0087_0009_0002$$$::"Even if it's a different country, if you throw them into there for three months, a person can get used to anything. [cacheimage storage=凛制服05c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛制服05c(中) pos=l time=300 textoff=0]Besides, Emiya might even say he'll follow me because he doesn't want to break up[line len=2]"[lr]::
11072::$$$message_0087_0009_0003$$$::"Gah!"::
11073::$$$message_0087_0010_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 pos=r storage=美綴02d(中) textoff=0]W-what the... Who would do such an embarrassing thing!?::
11074::$$$message_0087_0011_0000$$$::"Wow... I thought Emiya was more laid back."[lr]::
11075::$$$message_0087_0011_0001$$$::"Hahaha, I'm cool, it's fine!"[lr]::
11076::$$$message_0087_0011_0002$$$::"Well, when it comes to Tohsaka... You know, Emiya."[lr]::
11077::$$$message_0087_0011_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri pats me on the shoulder.[lr]::
11078::$$$message_0087_0011_0004$$$::She sighs before making an announcement.::
11079::$$$message_0087_0012_0000$$$::"With that kind of attitude, maybe you'll even manage to catch this one."[lr]::
11080::$$$message_0087_0012_0001$$$::"My, my, pot, meet kettle. I've heard boys have a hard time with you too, you know."[lr]::
11081::$$$message_0087_0012_0002$$$::"Shut up. Wait, that reminds me.[lr]::
11082::$$$message_0087_0012_0003$$$::Hold off on taking Emiya with you for a bit. Our match [wvl][se storage=se020.wav]hasn't been decided yet. Let's settle this once and for all with a shooting conte[line len=2]"::
11083::$$$message_0087_0013_0000$$$::"It's time, you two.[lr]::
11084::$$$message_0087_0013_0001$$$::Also Mitsuzuri, let's do that another time."[lr]::
11085::$$$message_0087_0013_0002$$$::"Ugh, taking the coward's route again[line len=2][cacheimage storage=美綴01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴01a(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka, tell me about your trip later!"[lr]::
11086::$$$message_0087_0013_0003$$$::"I have a lot of things...[cacheimage storage=凛制服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服01b(中) textoff=0] Well then, see you later, Emiya."[lr]::
11087::$$$message_0087_0013_0004$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]They both hurry away.[lr]::
11088::$$$message_0087_0013_0005$$$::All right, I head to my classroom.::

